{"title":"Elon wants to add MechaHitler to your car","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car","date":1752251905000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you wait to see if MrBeast becomes the new CEO of X, the everything app.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/16e39e83-cfa1-4ce2-b2e8-93bda14cd336/Screenshot_2025-07-11_at_10.54.56_AM__2_.png?t=1752245716\" /><div><span><p>(Will Stancil at his posting station/via KARE11)</p></span></div></div><p>This week was the end of the era where \"it all happens on X.” CEO Linda Yaccarino <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/07/09/linda-yaccarino-steps-down-as-ceo-of-elon-musks-x/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">left</a> so fast she briefly lost her <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/linda-yaccarino-loses-gains-blue-checkmark-x-ceo-musk-2025-7?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">blue check</a> on the way out. Concerning, looking into this! Other X employees are beginning to <a href=\"https://futurism.com/the-byte/grok-hitlergate-x-head-of-product-warning?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">reconsider</a> the idea of posting their way to the top. It still seems to work, though — look at longtime reply guy and <a href=\"https://nypost.com/2022/11/07/nick-adams-blasted-for-saying-alpha-males-should-take-their-families-to-hooters/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">Hooters Guardian</a> Nick Adams, who's been <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/10/us/politics/nick-adams-ambassador-malaysia-trump.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">appointed</a> by President Donald Trump as US Ambassador to Malaysia. In other news from the Everything App’s creepiest posters, the theoretically separate company xAI wants you to know they're <a href=\"https://www.vox.com/future-perfect/419631/grok-hitler-mechahitler-musk-ai-nazi?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">working hard</a> to delete all the sex-crazed Nazism and violent <a href=\"https://www.kare11.com/article/tech/x-elon-musk-grok-speech-twitter-ai-artificial-intelligence/89-8dad0222-d8c6-44d9-b07d-686e978ad8ac?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">Will Stancil-focused rape fantasies</a> from Grok. Soon it'll be a perfectly innocent chatbot, powered by a perfectly innocent <a href=\"https://tennesseelookout.com/2025/07/07/a-billionaire-an-ai-supercomputer-toxic-emissions-and-a-memphis-community-that-did-nothing-wrong/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">illegal smog factory</a>. Excited to have it as your <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/business/autos-transportation/grok-ai-be-available-tesla-vehicles-next-week-musk-says-2025-07-10/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">backseat driver</a> yet?</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/korven-kuningas/788258165062090752/i-could-really-use-a-wish-right-now?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">Some good Dashcon 2 cosplay</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/BruceWilliams__/status/1942310683904757948?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">A plot twist for the smell doctor</a> (X post)</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@4kbmedia/video/7524016339049041182?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">A good TikTok</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/Render96VGTP/status/1942555589936308525?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">Mario kart 64(マリオカート64) texture match</a> (X post)</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://mamdanitimes.com/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">The Mamdani Times</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/adamcurtisbroll/status/1943672742454136901?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">Dan Deacon sang the National Anthem at an Orioles game</a> (X post)</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/segamascott/788606502841761792?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">The perfect beach day</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/h3xenbrenner2/status/1943629493547012543?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">A basketball player’s worst nightmare</a> (X post)</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/mousegirlheart/788375524931256320/you-know-i-keep-that-mf-thang-on-me?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">Strapped and ready</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/opinions/2025/07/10/donald-trump-clown-clowns-without-borders/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">“I’m a clown. Donald Trump is not one of us.”</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/reiaposting/status/1943515976764367028?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">A good quote post</a> (X post)</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hh0Yukdydlo&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=elon-wants-to-add-mechahitler-to-your-car\" target=\"_blank\">Anamanaguchi’s Batman music video is so good</a></p></li></ul><h2>Grab Tickets For Garbage Day Live While You Still Can!</h2><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b2f27679-0e5c-4301-8472-f50eea3a2f44/3_combo3.png?t=1752248241\" /></div><p>We’ve got two more nights this month in our residency at <b>Baby’s All Right</b> in Brooklyn. Next Tuesday is all about Silicon Valley, with guest <b><span>Peter</span></b><span> </span><b><span>McIndoe</span></b><span>, the genius behind Birds Aren’t Real, and the week after that we’re diving into Trump’s first 100 days in office with podcaster extraordinaire </span><b><span>Akilah Hughes</span></b><span>. Grab tickets below while you still can. Last night was standing room only </span>👀</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/garbage-day/650291?afflky=BabysAllRightBrooklyn&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=just-the-regular-kind-of-a